{
  "title": "Fix Goal Tree Hierarchy and Sorting",
  "status": "closed",
  "prompt": "The goal tree command shows all goals flat without parent-child hierarchy. Goals stored in nested directories (e.g. R26-02/RUNNING-SKETCHPAD) should be rendered as children. Also sort goals by due date, then by creation date.",
